ns for connectivity and functionality. Businesses use specialized software for managing operations, finances, and customer relationships. Even household appliances and cars increasingly incorporate software for control and advanced features, demonstrating its pervasive influence across industries and daily activities.\\\&quot;]],[[2,\\\&quot;Exploring Hardware: The Physical Counterpart\\\&quot;]],[null,[\\\&quot;While software provides the instructions, hardware provides the physical components that carry out those instructions. This includes the computer itself, its internal components like the CPU and RAM, and peripheral devices such as monitors, keyboards, and printers. Software and hardware are interdependent; neither can function effectively without the other. Understanding both is key to comprehending how computing systems operate and interact with the world.\\\&quot;]]]],[2026,7,16],3]]],null,false,\\\&quot;Close shopping anchor\\\&quot;,\\\&quot;Go to shopping options for TERM\\\&quot;,null,null,null,null,[95377480,95376643,95395980,95387435,118585312,83323418,95388048,95332729,44782608,318527024,95391874,95360760,20235445,95375166,95383932,44729948,44735360,95393509,95391279,83323656,95393495,95386603,95331315,95396567,44737091,95389379,318528903,95353371,95371675,21046985,44798632,95386443,95396268,318528274,95393358,95393878,95394053,95395327,20235443,95390576,96843134,350920539,95396465,51390172,95394484,44735362,44712487,44763073,95387237,95388040,20238489,95326059,95369167,95383908,95384372,95396251,95389606,95390260,95391375,98953068,95354014,95393039,31099678,95370419,20237464,95395898,95380470,20235392,95366156,318528777,95384635,95367713,95389960,20236573,95372845,95380077,21046196,95396538,95380781,318482442,95382443,95396104,95380656,318528522,13886615,98953025,95393502,95352226,95395375,95395444,95395076,318520079,44735361,95388064,39592618,95383997,83323596,95369218,95392317,95393674,95354010,95344834,95358854,95393889,20222162,83323363,9537120